SUMMARY:Office Hours (Tuesdays)
DESCRIPTION:We'd love to see you at our coworking sessions! These are casu
 al\, drop-in-if-feel-like it sessions where you can: \n\n- Ask questions
  relating to OSS\, your campus OSPO\, or the OSPO network\n- Get help find
 ing a project to work on\, or getting more contributors for your own proje
 ct\n- Or just have a dedicated time to work on your projects or to tackle 
 those important-but-often-postponed admin tasks\n\nhttps://ucdavis.zoom.us
 /j/95278484683?pwd=9iHxiRLcMkdGXHoavyqiRj7JaM1fxK.1\n\nMeeting ID: 952 784
